    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d740">

                <pb facs="0789" n="475" sameAs="frus:frus1914Supp/pg475"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)</head>
                <dateline>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                    <placeName>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-06T19:00:00-05:00">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">August 6, 1914, 7 p.m.</hi>
                    </date>
                </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center">[Telegram]</p>
                <p>Your August 6, 1 a.m. Ascertain whether British Government would be willing to
                    enter such agreement. Other European nations at war have been asked whether they
                    are willing to enter such arrangements.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
